O.S. Systems Yocto BSP
======================

Quick Start Guide
-----------------

Once you have downloaded the source of all projects, you will have to
call:

    $ . ./setup-environment <build directory>

After this step, you will be with everything need for build an image.

To share settings such as DL_DIR or SSTATE_DIR across build
directories, put them in ~/.oe/site.conf (or ~/.yocto/site.conf);
setup-environment links it into each build's conf/. conf/site.conf
in this repository is an example to start from.
